  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If you lose your account for reasons other than bans; such as 2FA account loss, forgetting account information, or simply just wanting to delete your account and start fresh, there is no way to verify yourself on your new account. Once you verify an account with your ID, that ID can never be used to verify again. Those who spent the $10 on VRC+ to get ID verification are now not only out $10 but don't even get to keep their verification due to account loss. Sure, there are concerns about alt accounts and trolling, but it's punishing a large amount of the player base for a problem they're not involved in.",
